{"id":"vod_sn_39223","vodId":"39223","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"地球防卫少年","name_cn":"地球防卫少年","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/04fe9eeb5f2d607fa66e5410b0de2c97.jpg"},"summary":"和久隆（阪口大助 配音）、小高胜（保志总一朗 配音）、矢村大一（杉田智和 配音）、半井摩子（井口裕香 配音）等十五名少年少女，正满心希冀的准备迎接即将到来的暑假。就在此时，一位名为可可贝利的神秘男子突然出现，邀请孩子们参加一个电脑游戏。在游戏中，他们将会驾驶着巨大的机器人，和邪恶的外星物种进行战斗。　　在半推半就之中，孩子们和可可贝利定下了契约，而契约一旦签订，无论发生了什么，孩子们都不可能放弃这个游戏。然而，让他们没有想到的是，巨大的机器人行动所使用的能源，竟然就是他们的生命，也就是说，无论是失败还是胜利，每一个驾驶员们所要面对的结局只有一个，那就是死亡。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:08:22","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dU2kx13fvR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xfgLCNPK2Q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wAUeV0WjhA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iqxDnaXYeN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XH6wZmnxWF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kRV3Ge4xMW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aXqhLT2DH01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uKYJs92kNy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EGgtaJ3bV21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MrNScntf7R1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PhHidvLgUm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KRbHRWZ6ek1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9nrkSqrPYJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YuhDbMCvXm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","